  "_comment": "PNPT Procore Professional Services packages. Tools live at the PACKAGE level (with a position and an optional constraint), and each tier references which tools it includes via toolIds. connections describe canonical data flow between tools (direction: 'to' = source -> target dashed orange, 'from' = target -> source dashed black, 'both' = bidirectional solid orange — matching the ERP Connector Map convention). The renderer draws a node-link diagram and highlights the tools belonging to the currently selected tier(s). Verticals (GC/Owner/Specialty) gate which packages are available; per-vertical tool overrides can be added via tier.toolsByVertical or tool.names later.",
